00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.380
'Cause it dropped faster
than I was expecting.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:10.673
Well, at least fire goes up.

00:03:10.673 --> 00:03:11.506
It's true.

00:03:11.506 --> 00:03:12.680
It's not like it fell on the floor, is it?

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:13.580
Like, the main part of it,

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.980
I think the meat of it was in the middle.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.040
Careful, this might be on fire

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.960
and we might not be able to see it.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:17.980
I've put it out I think.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:18.813
Okay.

00:03:19.901 --> 00:03:20.903
From the beginning of
Watchmen or something.

00:03:20.903 --> 00:03:21.860
I look very menacing.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.256
It's looks like I'm
throwing the fire at you.

00:03:24.256 --> 00:03:26.020
That's the idea, isn't it?

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.793
Oh, yeah, look at that .

